        "h2": "Questions from finance leads.",
        "items": [
          {
            "question": "Can a payment wait for a person before it goes out?",
            "answer": "Yes. Add an approval step and the run pauses until an approver accepts or declines the exact amount."
          },
          {
            "question": "Do we need engineers to set this up?",
            "answer": "No. Most flows are built in the visual builder, with code available for the one step that needs it."
          },
          {
            "question": "Where does the data live?",
            "answer": "On the hosted cloud or on servers you run yourself; the flows are the same either way."
          },
          {
            "question": "Can we see what every run did?",
            "answer": "Every run keeps its inputs and outputs, so a reviewer can read what happened step by step."
          }
        ]
